            <div class="relative z-10 text-center md:text-left">
                <h3 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Ready to Build a Better Learning Experience?</h3>
                <p class="text-slate-300">Share your course idea, Kajabi setup, LMS, or existing learning content. We'll review it and recommend the clearest next step.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center items-center relative z-10">
                <a href="/book-free-audit/" class="shrink-0 bg-brand-accent text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-md font-bold text-sm hover-lift click-press focus-ring transition-all hover:bg-white hover:text-brand-navy shadow-lg text-center">
                    Get a 24–48 Hour Review
